    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "It seems you have recently participated in a KVM battle. You must wait 5 minutes before signing up again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "Let them know the real might of Guillaume!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "I will fight with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "End Conversation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "Show them how strong we are."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "Today, everyone will hear the shout of triumph from Guillaume!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "KVM Mercenary Officer",
      "text" : "We will win!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Hello."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "What do you want to know?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Apply for KVM."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "What is KVM?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "How do I participate in KVM?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "I want to know my Kreiger Points."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "If you are ready for battle, click the ^0000FFbattle button from the interface^000000 to apply for KVM battle!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Applications are not available yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "To apply, you need to go to a KVM Mercenary Officer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "KVM is the abbreviation of Kreiger Von Midgard."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Adventurer, are you aware that the way to the new world has been opened?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "We, the Guillaume Administration, have several plans to advance to the new world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "And KVM is one of them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "It means that we, one of many countries in the Midgard continent,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "have decided to employ many adventurers for the immediate advance to the new world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Therefore, to select the best adventurers, we are holding the KVM."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "We exspect responses from many adventurers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "And we will give them rewards for their participation!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "As for the rewards, please contact a KVM Logistic Officer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Basically, KVM is a 3 on 3 battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Apply by clicking on the ^0000FFbattle button from the interface^000000, as a group or individually."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Basically, KVM is a 5 on 5 battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "First, you apply with a KVM receptionist, in a group or individually."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Group applications are for when you intend to enter the KVM with your party or guild members,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Group applications are for when you intend to enter the KVM with your party members,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "and a personal application is for when you intend to enter the KVM individually."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Please be noted, once you cancel you ^0000FFcannot apply again for 1 minute^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Please apply with a KVM officer, and he will contact you later when you are in Prontera."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "Then you enter and follow the instructions in the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "However, please be advised that unless you are in the KVM office, he cannot contact you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]"
    },
    {
